# `prisma/schema.prisma`

This file defines your database connection and data models.

```prisma
datasource db {
  provider = "sqlite"
  url      = env("DATABASE_URL")
}

generator client {
  provider = "prisma-client-js"
}

model Post {
  id        Int      @id @default(autoincrement())
  title     String
  content   String
  createdAt DateTime @default(now())
}
```

Each model becomes a table. Prisma then generates a type‑safe client.

